you have to be unique  if you're in a competitive market  there's lots of competition doing  exactly what you're doing you have to  find a way to be unique and stand out  and be different to capture people's  attention i got a great question from  one of my readers nick nick wants to  start a promotional products company  he's actually already started it but  it's part time and he wants to be able  to leave his full-time job  to make this business happen and he's  wondering how do i get more sales for  this company nick  the promotional product space is one of  the most competitive businesses out  there and if you are only competing on  price  you're going to lose people are racing  to the bottom  charging lower and lower and lower and  lower amounts  and if that's the game you're playing  you're not going to win you're not going  to get great clients those aren't the  clients that you want people are only  buying from you because of price that's  not an ideal client for you you have to  find a way  to be different to be unique to bring  more of yourself to your business to  give people a reason to talk about you  hey entrepreneurs we're all in  competitive fields there aren't too many  entrepreneurs who can say  oh yeah there's this huge market that  i'm reaching out to and i have no  competition  it's competitive it's a tough tough  world being an entrepreneur  you have to be unique and maybe that is  in your offering maybe you have unique  products that nobody else is selling  maybe you have a theme maybe you have  the most unique you know baseball themed  products whatever it is and you're going  to attract people who want baseball  products  maybe you have the best service in the  business maybe you have a mission that  people can believe in and you give a  portion of your sales to charity  something you need something that's  going to help stand out  because if you are just like everybody  else you're going to get mediocre to  below average results  the good news is here  most companies are not unique  you may not be unique right now but you  know what your competition isn't either  this gives you a great chance to stand  out  the way to start is think about what is  it that is special about you because  nobody else can be you nobody else can  bring you to your business what do you  believe in what are some of your other  passions how can you bring that to your  business  so you're the best guy at promotional  products for this industry or who  believes in these values  something if you could bring that in  then you're going to bring people who  are like-minded with you who love what  you're all about who want to share your  stuff who want to buy from you and  they'll be great customers and they'll  buy more from you and they'll refer  customers on to you  they'll talk about you  it's so critical  most entrepreneurs never go through this  step they just try to look at how can i  make some money in this business  and if that's all you're looking at  you're going to fail you're not going to  get great results  so really for the next week think about  what makes you so unique and how you can  bring more of that flavor into your  business to help you stand out  for any entrepreneur who's in a  competitive business  it's one of the most important things  you have to do if you can't figure that  out you're not going to have success but  when you do  you're going to have a line  of ideal customers who believe in what  you believe  coming to you because nobody is doing  this your competition is not doing this  the top people in your business are  barely doing this  there's always room for quality at the  top and if you can position yourself to  be unique and stand for something  important and have a unique offering  the market is yours and i want to hear  about your success  believe  for those of you watching like the video  please give it a thumbs up below and i  want to hear what you have to think  leave a comment below you have a  question leave it below i'll make a  response for you thank you so much and  i'll see you soon

